window.products.push({"id":531034,"name":"NERUB Reusable Grocery Shopping Bags Heavy Duty Grocery Tote Bags with Reinforced Bottom Foldable Large Reusable Shopping Bags for Groceries (3 Pack)","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":25.99,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/81fF1+mSTcL._AC_SL1200_.jpg","description":"SET OF 3 ATTRACTIVE STURDY TOTES: A stylish option that stands upright and carries hefty loads. The sturdy construction and well structured design keep kitchen reusable grocery bags from tipping over in your trunk. Reusable grocery bags can hold up to 50 pounds. They are strong enough to hold several milk or juice cartons and plenty of groceries. When not in use they fold flat for easy storage. You can also use them for storage bins in the pantry or closet for example they make great shoe bins. EXTRA LARGE AND STURDY BOTTOM: Reusable shopping bags are box-shaped with a foldable and collapsible design, making them easy to carry and offer a large capacity. Shopping bags offer space equivalent to 10 single-use plastic bags. Our cloth shopping bags also have a very sturdy bottom insert for stability, so there is never a worry when carrying heavy items. The handles stitching goes to the bottom, so you can have even more peace of mind when carrying your valuable items KEEP YOUR GROCERIES ORGANIZED: These square reusable grocery bags bulk are stable and the long handles are sewn all the way down and into the reinforced bottom edging. The collapsible shopping bag long handles also allow you to safely sling the bag over your shoulder or easily carry tall items. To add even more convenience, shopping bags for groceries heavy duty fold into a nearly flat shape that can easily be stored under a car seat or in your pantry WATER RESISTANT AND EASY TO CLEAN: Easy to clean with a damp cloth, simply allow to air dry after cleaning. A great and greener alternative to grocery store bags. You save the planet, and make the whole process of getting groceries easier and more pleasant. The shopping bags for groceries come in a 3-pack. Biodegradable construction, Folding design for compact storage, Tough handle secured with metal. REUSABLE SHOPPING GROCERY BAGS: Quality fabric, sturdy straps, and reinforced bottoms make a great product. Most people are on the lookout for grocery tote bags that can stand up to the rigors of shopping, but also store flat for the car. It is such a pleasure not to have to fight a bag to get groceries to fit in and store reusable bags neatly in the car, making tote bags fit the bill","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/81fF1+mSTcL._AC_SL1200_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"NERUB","source_asin":"B09H5HW1M2","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-531034","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B09H5HW1M2","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B09H5HW1M2","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
