window.products.push({"id":531036,"name":"Fine Bone China Secret Garden Mug Set with Lid","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":0.0,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/4169OEF9JKL._AC_.jpg","description":"Fine Bone China from Hankook Chinaware combines world class quality and design. 50% of purified bone ash is added to each product to create an extreme high quality, high translucency Chinaware. Fine bone China is baked in an 2282 degree oven to give its luster. Due to the addition of the purified bone ash, the Chinaware has higher translucency that minimizes absorption of moisture. Therefore, it produces a strong, yet lightweight product. Microwave Oven and Dishwasher Safe. Made in Korea.","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/4169OEF9JKL._AC_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"Hankook Chinaware","source_asin":"B003TFVIKO","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-531036","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B003TFVIKO","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B003TFVIKO","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
window.products.push({"id":531037,"name":"Kuhn Rikon Auto Safety LidLifter/Can Opener with Ring Pull, 8 x 2.5 x 2.75 inches, Black","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":21.38,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61i4-Y7KhNL._AC_SL1490_.jpg","description":"Open your cans/tins with hygiene in mind courtesy of the Auto Safety LidLifter from Kuhn Rikon. Once attached via the automatic, ‘lock-on’ mechanism, the opener removes lids without any contact whatsoever with the contents of the can/tin. It also prevents the all-too-common problem of lids falling into the can/tin. The device is safe to use as well as being hygienic: it doesn’t actually cut the metal, which ensures that unwanted sharp edges do not remain on either the can/tin or the lid. After a full rotation around the lid - and a noticeable reduction in resistance - the can/tin is open (and no more turning is required). To complete the job, simply lift the lid from the can/tin using the mini-pliers/pincers.","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61i4-Y7KhNL._AC_SL1490_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"KUHN RIKON","source_asin":"B007MASKF8","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-531037","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B007MASKF8","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B007MASKF8","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
window.products.push({"id":531038,"name":"MOSTOP Christmas Gnomes Plush Set of 2, Handmade Swedish Tomte Mr&Mrs Santa Scandinavian Figurine Nordic Plush Elf Doll Gnome Ornaments Christmas Deco","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":0.0,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/81LoHOZEgOL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","description":"❤ Story of the Lucky Gnome ❤ 💕 In Sweden there is the gnome, which also known as a Tomte or Nisse. They are reputed to safeguard the farmer and his family against any misfortune with magic.  💕 It was especially during the night that the tomte was actively being protective.No one had really seen it except for his little footprints in the snow. 💕 It is customary to express acknowledgement to the tomte by leaving him a bowl of porridge on Christmas Eve. The belief in the tomte has been widespread in Scandinavian countries and to this day Sweden still has stories of him. ❤ Features: 💕 Extra long hat with a wire in. Could be shaped as you like. 💕 Handmade crafts. Festive & popular gift for kids adults. 💕 A couple of tomte, 13\" tall from top to bottom. Super value for money. 💕 Fully handmade by quality materials: It's made of soft felt fabric. Beard is made of brown faux fur/ braids, and a wooden bead nose sticks in it under the hat. Oval Bottom is medium weighted and sits very well.  💕 Nice Christmas decorations: Gnome's lucky symbol and strong mystery will inevitably bring us happiness, warmth and also add a little imagination to our home. ❤ Specifications: 💕 Material: plush and felt 💕 Weight: 14.2 OZ 💕 Size: 13\" tall, 5\" wide. 💕 Style: Christmas tomte decoration ❤ Recommended Usage: 💕 As a Christmas gift, share them with your friends & family. 💕 Great holiday table decor, mentel centerpiece or under the tree ornaments. 💕 Not only suitable for Christmas, but for Thanksgiving Day, Halloween, Birthday party. ❤ Notes: We also welcome wholesale orders. Contact us for a discount if you need PLENTY! ❤ Package Includes: 2 x Tomte ornaments.","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/81LoHOZEgOL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"Mostop","source_asin":"B08HGJCQH5","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-531038","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B08HGJCQH5","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B08HGJCQH5","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
