window.products.push({"id":531245,"name":"Ceramic Growler - 32 oz Hand-made Stoneware Beer Growler for Craft Beer Lovers and Home Brewers with Big Hop emblem and Metallic Brown Glaze","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":0.0,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/512HvUkf4RL._AC_SL1000_.jpg","description":"The 32 oz beer growler is the perfect size for toting a sample of your latest batch or filling several when you just can’t decide what to get from the local craft brew supplier. Not only that but stoneware clay is a natural insulator, keeping out 100% of the harmful, beer skunking light rays that penetrate even the darkest brown glass growlers. It may be hard to believe, but every piece of Bubba Jones pottery was not slip cast or molded, hydraulically extruded or 3D printed, but made in the USA from stoneware clay, one at a time, by hand, on the potter’s wheel, with a hand pulled handle and hand dipped glaze, each one truly unique. The perfect gift for any home brewer or craft beer enthusiast who enjoys a quality drinking experience. The goal at Bubba Jones Brew Cups is to employ great skill, craftsmanship and design in creating vessels that feel real, connecting the maker to the user to the beverage. Enjoy responsibly! Keep in mind that each piece is unique so it will vary some in size, shape and color. Also, even though this growler is lead free and dishwasher safe, no growler should ever be cleaned in the dishwasher. At best your beer will end up tasting like soap. Following the simple care instructions included with each growler should result in years of enjoyment. Every piece should work properly and be free of manufacturer defects. Please get in touch immediately if there are any issues that need to be resolved.","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/512HvUkf4RL._AC_SL1000_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"Bubba Jones Brew Cups & More Ltd.","source_asin":"B01LZQEFM9","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-531245","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B01LZQEFM9","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B01LZQEFM9","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
