window.products.push({"id":531279,"name":"GDOR Citrus Juicer Electric with Enhanced Sharper & Taller Cones, Powerful & Ultra-Silent 150W Motor Juice Squeezer Machine for Orange, Lemon, Grapefr","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":0.0,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/616JfcPaJ6L._AC_SL1500_.jpg","description":"[Upgraded Citrus Juicer With Soft Handle] - GDOR Electric Juicer JS3401 extracts 20% more juice, vitamins and minerals in less time with the enhanced sharper & taller cone and quieter motor than other similar juicers. Moreover, automatic on/off function is easy to use, practical anti-drip spout prevents dripping and keep the work top clean. [More Juice in Less Time] - The lemon squeezer electric features a enhanced sharper & taller cone to extract up to 20% more juice, vitamins and minerals than other similar juicers. Besides, the efficient extraction system saves time and effort. Soft grip handle provides superior experience for you. [Quieter & Powerful Motor] - According to GDOR lab data, only 65dB when operating, it is 23% quieter than most of other juicers on the market. No worries about noise anymore! In addition, the orange juice squeezer is equipped with overload protection for longer service life. [Dual Cones for All Citrus] - The lime juicer provides a large cone and a small cone. Two sizes cones can easily handle all types and all sizes of citrus fruits, includes orange, lemon, lime, grapefruit and other citrus fruit. [Delicious & Pure Juices] - Its integrated filter for seedless, fresh juices or lemonade all the time – hassle-free! The filter effectively captures pits and other unwanted residues. Leftover pulp is collected in the removable filter, so you can use it later in bread or other recipes. [Anti-Drip & Convenient Spout] - The anti-drip spout of grapefruit juicer prevents dripping and keep the work top clean. Life the spout to retain the juice on the juice container, push it for easily transferring the juice to bottle. Large container can store more juice in one operation. [Easy to Clean] - All parts of the orange juicer are BPA-Free and detachable, parts contacting with food can be washed with water or immersed in water directly. It is convenient and labor-saving. Please do not rinse the motor with water. [Life Time Service] - GDOR has a professional after-sales service team, who provide life time service. Just try it risk-free! Our total satisfaction promise covers all our products. In the unlikely event that you don’t satisfied, will offer you a replacement or a full refund. [Tips for Operating] - The first operating cycle is 10 minutes of running and 2 minutes of rest. Each subsequent cycle is a 5 minute-run with a 2-minute rest. In this way, service life of this juice maker will be prolonged, the machine will serve you more efficiently. [Overload Protection] - This lemonade maker is equipped with motor overload protection. If the motor stops during operation due to overheating, unplug and allow it to cool down for for 20 to 30 minutes before using again.","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/616JfcPaJ6L._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"GDOR","source_asin":"B0B7VQCFMF","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-531279","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B0B7VQCFMF","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B0B7VQCFMF","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
