window.products.push({"id":531671,"name":"Prepworks by Progressive Easy Twist Spiralizer","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":29.99,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61rcz9UCfiL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","description":"With easily adjustable rotating blades, the Prepworks by Progressive Easy Twist Spiralizer is a must have tool for any kitchen. Perfect for spiralizing foods such as zucchini, squash, carrots, potatoes and much more! this essential piece can be used on the counter or over a bowl, pan, or plate and has non-skid feet that fold in for easy storage. This spiralizer has three cutting options: thick and thin julienne and ribbon. The easy twist spiralizer is patent pending and measures 12.38\"L x 7.25\"H x 5.38\"W. For over 40 years, our mission has been to create innovative kitchen tools and gadgets that make food preparation fun and fast while inspiring culinary creativity. From our thinstore™ collapsibles to our sophisticated PL8™ line, our dedication to providing quality products supported by superior customer service continues to drive our creative development today. At Progressive International, we continually strive to understand the needs of today’s cooks. Our team includes talented, energetic and passionate people committed to reimagining the kitchen. We strive to pass our passion on to our consumers through our thoughtfully designed tools, layered with our avid desire to go beyond the expected. Our philosophy is simple: offer stylish designs complimented by no-nonsense functionality. We understand the kitchen is the heart of the home, where families and friends connect.  Our ongoing mission is to provide exceptional kitchen essentials that help cooks of all skill levels create meals worth sharing. Prep Solutions;, Prepworks and PL8 continues to build on the Progressive; legacy by offering products that make food prep faster, easier and more enjoyable.","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61rcz9UCfiL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"Progressive International","source_asin":"B01LVUSOLP","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-531671","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B01LVUSOLP","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B01LVUSOLP","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
window.products.push({"id":531672,"name":"LUCID L100 Adjustable Bed Base with Lucid 10 Inch Gel Memory Foam Mattress - King","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":0.0,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/71DGg9rrOjL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","description":"Base: Compatible with all LUCID mattresses and most other mattresses under 14 inches; can fit in most bed frames Base: Independent head incline: 0 - 58 degrees, foot incline 0 - 40 degrees for more comfort when relaxing and sleeping Mattress: Dual-layer mattress combines 2.5\" gel-infused, ventilated memory foam surface + 7.5\" high density foam base for excellent support with a medium-firm feel Mattress: Gel infused memory foam regulates temperature while conforming to the body to ease pressure points Two Twin XL bases make a King; includes two Twin XL bases and one King mattress","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/71DGg9rrOjL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"LUCID","source_asin":"B07T5G68SR","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-531672","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B07T5G68SR","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B07T5G68SR","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
window.products.push({"id":531673,"name":"Pooqla 7FT 187 LEDs Light Up Palm Tree, Lighted Tropical Palm Trees, LED Palm Tree with Lights, Artificial Tree for Indoor, Outdoor Pool Patio Garden ","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":0.0,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/71hcqe0KQhL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","description":"Lighted Tropical Palm Tree: The faux palm tree is designed with brown straight trunk and green palm leaves with LED lights, can brings you the tropical island style. LED palm tree is perfect for living room, office and front porch decor. Artificial Palm Tree with 187 LEDs: Decorated with 139 Green LED lights hidden in the 17 green silk fronds, and 48 Warm White LED lights attached to the brown trunk. Realistic palm tree with charming lights can make your home more attractive. 7FT Light Up Tree: Overall height of this tree is 7 feet. The dimension of base is 9.8x9.8in. Details in picture. Easily Assembled: The fake palm tree is very easy to assemble. Just need screw the trunk into the base, and separately connect 2 trunks and the male & female plug, then plug in the power and get a lighted palm tree. Outdoor Lighted Palm Tree: IP44 waterproof LED tree, suitable for all-season outdoor decoration. Note: The plug is not waterproof, please keep it dry. Adjustable Branches: The 17 green palm leaves are adjustable, you can bend the branches into the shape you like. Home Decoration Tree Lightr: Palm tree lights is powered by 4.5V low voltage adaptor, which is more energy saving and safe. Widely Application: Faux palm tree light is a perfect decorative tree for beach, swimming pool, yard, balcony, patio, lawn, garden, living room, bar, office, Hawaii tropical party, Palm Sunday, St. Patrick's Day, Summer, Nativity, Wedding, Festival, Vacation, Holiday. It is also a good gift for family and friends.","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/71hcqe0KQhL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"Pooqla","source_asin":"B0B5FYN8HT","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-531673","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B0B5FYN8HT","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B0B5FYN8HT","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
window.products.push({"id":531674,"name":"Kuchenprofi Stainless Steel Mesh Oyster Glove, 7.5cm","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":17.95,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51r7-vgcW6L._AC_SL1500_.jpg","description":"Founded in Solingen Germany by Artur Schmitz in 1923, the story of Kuchenprofi is one of diligence, innovation and refinement. Early on, Kuchenprofi realized the need for affordable functional tools that make the kitchen more efficient and more enjoyable. The name of Kuchenprofi reflects strength, quality and functionality demanded by chefs around the world. Kuchenprofi made for professionals, now available to anyone passionate about cooking. This Kuchenprofi oyster glove is constructed with a sturdy stainless steel wire mesh to protect hands when shucking oysters. It can be used on a left or right hand and features an adjustable strap that holds the glove on the hand. It is easy to clean but should only be washed by hand. One size fits most.","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51r7-vgcW6L._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"Küchenprofi","source_asin":"B0027U3KQW","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-531674","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B0027U3KQW","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B0027U3KQW","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
