window.products.push({"id":531779,"name":"Premium Mexican Copal Incense 40 Sticks, 2 Bags with 20 Sticks Each. Handmade in Mexico with Authentic Copal Resin.","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":0.0,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51qN0G86jIL._AC_.jpg","description":"Experience the true aroma of Templo Totonaca Copal Incense. Please watch video on how to burn this incense sticks: https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=TABruQ27sUE Get 40 sticks made with high quality Mexican Copal resin extracted from trees of the Burseraceae family, using the ancient traditional methods of the Mexican \"Copaleros\". Each incense stick is hand rolled, it weights 3 to 4 g, and will burn for about 1.5 hours. As these sticks are thicker and heavier than regular incense sticks, we recommend to burn it in a pot (just as shown on picture # 6). This exclusive incense is never missing in the spiritual ceremonies of the Mexicans. It is considered to be the \"bread of the Gods\", so it is used as a special offering to God. It is also used for its healing properties, and to purify all persons and things around you. Fill your space with the aroma of the ancient rituals, bring blessings to your life while enjoying the mystical aroma of Mexican Copal Incense. As per burning incense sticks of any kind, please follow safety procedures: do not burn near a window curtain, place incense burner on a stable area, do not burn near the reach of children or pets, do not leave unattended. Our Copal Incense Sticks are safe to burn, just as any other kind of incense sticks. Enjoy!","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51qN0G86jIL._AC_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"Generic","source_asin":"B0BTBN6PRQ","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-531779","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B0BTBN6PRQ","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B0BTBN6PRQ","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
window.products.push({"id":531780,"name":"MiiR Stainless Steel Slate Insulated Water Bottle","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":0.0,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61XNodATi7L._AC_SL1500_.jpg","description":"The MiiR bottle's one-twist lid and perfectly-sized opening make your daily hydration effortless. Vacuum-insulated technology keeps your water cold through heated-yoga classes or in your car on a hot day (and easily fits in your cup-holder!) Hot drinks stay steamy on those wintery days. The strategically sized opening is wide enough to fit ice cubes yet narrow enough to go for a chug without getting a water beard. Patented design. As if you needed another reason to love this bottle, MiiR invests proceeds from every bottle to provide one person in need with access to clean water. To prove their impact they include a coded bracelet that unveils GPS coordinates and photos of the well project you help build. Transparency is a beautiful thing.","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61XNodATi7L._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"MiiR","source_asin":"B004IA3I8Y","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-531780","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B004IA3I8Y","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B004IA3I8Y","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
