window.products.push({"id":531823,"name":"Glass Spice Jars with Label Set, Bamboo Lids & Funnel - Kitchen Airtight Storage Jars with Lids - Spices and Seasonings Sets Organizer, Spice Glass Ja","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":19.99,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/A16j47SB1SL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","description":"COMPLETE SPICE JAR SEASONING ORGANIZER SET: Contains 12 clear glass square spice jars, 12 shaker lids, 3 different types of labels of, a marker, and a collapsible silicone funnel for refilling. All essential accessories are included in this pack, so no need for other purchases. PREMIUM DURABLE GLASS JARS: These spice jars are made of thick glass with a square shape of high-transparency visibility, so you can see the contents in the jar directly with what’s inside and how much left. Food-grade glass is healthy for food ingredients, totally BPA free, lead free and shatter-resistance. FOOD-GRADE MATERIALS: The materials in this set are food safe and healthy for your food and herb ingredients, totally BPA free, lead free and shatter-resistance. DUAL FUNCTION SHAKER BOTTLE LIDS: For powder, spices, and herbs, we have a special 2-in-1 shaker cap for pouring granulated spices, herbs & grains on one side, and sprinkling powdered ground spices on the other. It can be used according to the type of spice without changing the lid. In addition, the cute and airtight bamboo lids keep your spices fresh and dry. VARIOUS TYPES OF IDENTIFIABLE LABELS: Included are various types of preprinted waterproof pre-cut edge labels which can be easily removed and attached for repeated use for all your favorite spices and herb ingredients. The labels contain almost all the spices and food contents and even some blank labels and a marker for you to write exclusive spices. Affixed labels on the jar not only have a distinguishing role but is also decorative looking more beautiful and coordinated. KITCHEN ORGANIZATION AND STORAGE SET: This pack of spice jars is a must-have for daily use for you and your family's cooking. Say goodbye to the unnecessary messy spice packages and cluttered kitchens or pouring and shedding, and let your variety of seasoning be more orderly and beautiful while easily locating your cooking spices. AMAZING GIFT: These jars are the perfect gift choice for Housewarming, Mother's Day, Christmas, New Year, Birthday & Anniversary present. Our empty glass spice bottles with labels are perfect for you & your loved ones! It fits any spice rack, cupboard, organizer, drawer, or kitchen. The bamboo lid spice jars make a variety of spices more neat and beautiful to display in your kitchen. SATISFACTION GUARANTEE: We are committed to providing each customer with the highest standard of satisfaction. If you have any problem with the Le'raze set of spice jars, please feel free to contact our team, and we will gladly assist you.","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/A16j47SB1SL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"Le'raze","source_asin":"B0BLY5GQPX","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-531823","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B0BLY5GQPX","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B0BLY5GQPX","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
