window.products.push({"id":531878,"name":"DITOSH Stovetop Espresso Maker Stainless Steel Moka Pot Espresso Maker Percolator Italian Coffee Maker Capable Moka Coffee Machine Cafe Percolator Mak","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":17.49,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61IduTKjXLL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","description":"☕【COMPATIBLE WITH ALL STOVETOPS】 This stovetop espresso maker is suitable for any stove, such as gas, induction stove, ceramic stove, electric stove, alcohol stove and propane camping stove. You don't need to go out, you can easily make your favorite lattes, mochas, smoothies, macchiatos, cappuccinos, and americanos. We use high quality ingredients to make the extraction pits to mellow the coffee and bring high quality coffee to you to enjoy! ☕【STAINLESS STEEL DESIGN】Espresso coffee maker body through polishing design, smooth stainless steel material, three-ring precision thread, and pressure-tested safety valve to make your use process safer. Built-in safety relief valve to ensure that there will be no overpressure. It is corrosion resistant, rust resistant and easy to clean.(2PCS Gasket Seal Ring: We have sent an extra rubber seal ring for each type of coffee pot. The gasket is expendable and can be replaced.) ☕【EASY TO USE】When you use it for the first time, the coffee pot may emit an unpleasant smell, please don't worry too much, this is a normal phenomenon. Pls add tea, oranges, detergent, or other items to remove odor and wash several times before use. Fill the lower part of the Italian espresso maker with water, put the ground coffee into the percolator, put the top on, and place the espresso pot on the cooker to boil. After using the stovetop espresso machine, please rinse it with clean water. ☕【ABOUT CAPACITY】Standard espresso coffee cup is 50ml. 4Cup/6.7oz/200ml; 6Cup/10oz/300ml; 9Cup/15oz/450ml; 12Cup/20oz/600ml. DITOSH Mocha Coffee Maker with strong aroma can make delicious espresso for you in 5 minutes, you will be impressed by its rich flavor and aroma immediately. Tip: 80% of customers feedback that 12 cups is the best size for home use, 4/6/9 cups will be smaller than expected, so it is recommended to buy a larger capacity coffee pot to reduce your exchange troubles. ☕【SATISFACTION GUARANTEE】If you have any dissatisfaction with our products in 30 days after purchase, whether the packaging is broken or the accessories are missing，please feel free to contact us via email. We will solve the problem for you within 24 hours. DITOSH is always dedicating to guarantee your 100% satisfaction and provide a joyous environment for your dearest pets with love and comfort. Please remember that your satisfaction is our ultimate goal!","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61IduTKjXLL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"DITOSH","source_asin":"B0BS466HNS","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-531878","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B0BS466HNS","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B0BS466HNS","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
