window.products.push({"id":531970,"name":"Mi Zone Rosalie Comforter Set for Girls, Ultra-Soft Microlight Plush Metallic Printed Hearts Brushed Reverse Overfilled Down Alternative Hypoallergeni","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":78.61,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/71oJb-5-a4L._AC_SL1500_.jpg","description":"The Mi Zone Rosalie Metallic Printed Plush Comforter Set brings a bright and casual update to your bedroom. A silver metallic heart print adorns the aqua plush comforter and shams (1 in Twin/TwinXL) creating a soft and fun look. An oblong decorative pillow with a pompom trim and hearts adds a lovely touch to the bedding set. This bedding set is also OEKO-TEX certified, meaning it does not contain any harmful substances or chemicals to ensure quality comfort. Items in the set may come in a rolled or compressed packaging, which will need to be fluffed up or steam ironed before use to remove wrinkles.","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/71oJb-5-a4L._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"MI ZONE","source_asin":"B07XM6Z6RF","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-531970","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B07XM6Z6RF","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B07XM6Z6RF","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
window.products.push({"id":531971,"name":"Iron & Copper Essential Oil Burner, Resin Incense Burner, Aromatherapy Burner with Tea Light Candle Holder – Handcrafted Old World Charm","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":0.0,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/81VFDSb4aVL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","description":"Elevate your home rituals and scent your space naturally with our traditionally handcrafted oil warmer from India. Functionality and elegance meet with this stunning and unique incense resin and oil burner, making it a perfect addition to any sacred space and home! Featuring a brightly polished hammered copper bowl resting in a rustic, black cast iron base. It is a substantial piece. Easy to use. Just fill the bowl about 2/3 full with water and add 5-8 drops of essential oil. Put the candle below and light. The tea light flame will heat the oils to diffuse the aroma. Tealight candle not included. To use with resin incense: place some of your favorite resin incense into the copper bowl and light candle. As the resin warms it will begin to melt, releasing its gorgeous scent throughout your home. TIP: Place a bit of aluminum foil in the indention of the copper bowl before you add the resin. Lining the bowl will make cleanup or swapping resin types quick and easy! HINT: For harder resins and woods, consider using a votive instead of a tea light. Handcrafted. Approximate size: 5.75”L x 3.75”W x 4.25”H.","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/81VFDSb4aVL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"Red Silk Essentials","source_asin":"B07TD6R98N","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-531971","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B07TD6R98N","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B07TD6R98N","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
